    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13199" root="دنس" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَنَسٌ</span></b>  <i>Dirt; filth; soil,</i> or <i>pollution:</i> (S, M,
A, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدْنَاسٌ</span>. (M.) [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ يَتَصَوَّنُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنَ الأَدْنَاسُ</span> (tropical:)  [<i>He preserves his honour from
pollutions</i>], and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنَ المَدَانِسِ</span></b>  (tropical:)  [<i>from causes of
pollution,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَدَانِسُ</span> being pl. of ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَدْنَسَةٌ</span></b> , a noun of
the same kind as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَبْخَلَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْبَنَةٌ</span>]. (A, TA.)

